{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "AI Provider Gateway API",
    "description": "REST API dla chat completions (JSON) oraz streamingu (SSE) nad adapterami Anthropic / Google Gemini.\n\n**Zakres produktu:** rdzeń MVP = routing + chat + streaming; providery MVP = Anthropic + Google Gemini. **System prompt** jest składany po stronie serwera z plików w `src/config/system-prompt/` (warstwy MASTER / MAIN / opcjonalnie per alias); w `messages[]` dozwolone są wyłącznie role `user` i `assistant` — patrz `docs/konfiguracja.md`, `docs/architektura.md`.\n\n**Odporność (`ResilientExecutor`):** dla każdego aliasu z `gateway.config.yaml` stosowane są `policy.timeoutMs`, `policy.retry.maxAttempts` i `policy.retry.onStatus` (domyślnie z `RETRY_POLICY_DEFAULTS` w `src/common/retry-policy-defaults.ts`). Retry dotyczy wyłącznie błędów HTTP z listy `onStatus` (domyślnie 429, 500, 502, 503, 504). Po wyczerpaniu prób na aliasie pierwszym, opcjonalnie **`models[].fallback`** uruchamia drugi alias (bez pętli — walidacja Zod przy starcie + `assertNoFallbackCycle` w runtime). Przy sukcesie na fallbacku odpowiedź zawiera opcjonalne **`effectiveModelAlias`**. Timeout → **504** (`PROVIDER_TIMEOUT`). Szczegóły: `docs/konfiguracja.md`, `docs/dokumentacja_api.md`.\n\n**Auth i limity na brzegu:** endpointy **`POST /api/v1/chat`** i **`POST /api/v1/chat/stream`** używają **`@GatewayKeyAndSmartRateLimit()`**: **`GatewayKeyGuard`** + **`SmartRateLimitGuard`**. Nagłówek: `X-Gateway-Key`; allowlista z `masterKeyRef` i niepustych `clients[].gatewayKeyRef` w `gateway.config.yaml`. Health bez klucza. Błędy klucza: **401** (`GATEWAY_KEY_MISSING`), **403** (`GATEWAY_KEY_INVALID`), **500** (`GATEWAY_KEY_NOT_CONFIGURED`).\n\n**Smart rate limiting** (`src/rate-limit/`, `RATE_LIMIT_SMART_ENABLED=true`, Redis): token bucket per `X-Gateway-Key`, limit równoległych streamów; limity z `clients[].rateLimit` w `gateway.config.yaml` lub domyślne z env (`RATE_LIMIT_RPS_PER_KEY`, `RATE_LIMIT_BURST_PER_KEY`, `RATE_LIMIT_STREAMS_CONCURRENT`). Cooldown po 429 od providera (**tylko** `POST /api/v1/chat`) — **`RATE_LIMITED`**. Limit upstream providera — **`PROVIDER_RATE_LIMITED`**. Bez `@nestjs/throttler`. Szczegóły: `docs/konfiguracja.md`, `docs/dictionary.md`.\n\n**Format błędów:** envelope **`ErrorEnvelope`** (`GlobalExceptionFilter`). Słownik: `docs/dictionary.md`.\n\n**Korelacja (`requestId`):** **`RequestIdMiddleware`** — nagłówek żądania **`x-request-id`** (echo) lub `req_<uuid>`; to samo ID w polu JSON **`requestId`** oraz w **nagłówku odpowiedzi** **`x-request-id`** (wszystkie trasy objęte middleware, w tym health).\n\n**Cache (`POST /api/v1/chat`):** `noop` / `redis` — **`cached`**, **`cachedAt`**. Streaming bez cache.\n\n**Walidacja body:** `messages` 1–150, `content` max 3000 znaków; **`conversationId`** opcjonalnie w formacie `conv_<uuid>`; **`params`** z `allowOverrides` / `bounds`. **Response:** zawsze `conversationId` (echo lub `conv_<uuid>`). **Sentry:** `gen_ai.conversation.id` tylko gdy klient poda `conversationId` w request. `ValidationPipe` + limit JSON **1 MB**.\n\n**Dokumentacja ludzka:** `docs/`. **Swagger UI:** `/api-docs` (JSON: `/api-docs/swagger.json`). **Pozostałość v1:** `npm run config:validate` (placeholder), `CORS_ORIGINS` w `.env.example` bez implementacji w kodzie.",
    "version": "0.12.0",
    "contact": {}
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "http://localhost:3000",
      "description": "Przykład lokalny"
    }
  ],
  "tags": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "description": "Liveness i readiness"
    },
    {
      "name": "Chat",
      "description": "Chat completions (standard + streaming)"
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/api/v1/chat": {
      "post": {
        "description": "Pełna odpowiedź JSON. Cache, smart rate limit, ResilientExecutor, opcjonalny fallback (effectiveModelAlias).",
        "operationId": "ChatController_chat",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "x-request-id",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "Opcjonalny ID korelacji. Gdy brak, gateway ustawia req_<uuid> w odpowiedzi/błędzie.",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "example": "req_01HZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatRequestDto"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatResponseDto"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Walidacja, MODEL_ALIAS_NOT_FOUND, MODEL_NOT_ALLOWED, STREAMING_NOT_SUPPORTED (stream)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelopeDto"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "GATEWAY_KEY_MISSING",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelopeDto"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "GATEWAY_KEY_INVALID",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelopeDto"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "RATE_LIMITED lub PROVIDER_RATE_LIMITED",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelopeDto"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR, GATEWAY_KEY_NOT_CONFIGURED",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelopeDto"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "502": {
            "description": "PROVIDER_UNSUPPORTED, PROVIDER_UNAVAILABLE",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelopeDto"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "504": {
            "description": "PROVIDER_TIMEOUT",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelopeDto"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "GatewayKeyAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "summary": "Chat (standard)",
        "tags": [
          "Chat"
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/chat/stream": {
      "post": {
        "description": "SSE (`text/event-stream`): kolejność zdarzeń `meta` → `delta`* → `done` (pusty `{}`).\n\nTen sam body co POST /chat. Błędy JSON (ErrorEnvelope) tylko **przed** flushHeaders.\n\nPo rozpoczęciu streamu błędy mogą być częściowym SSE.",
        "operationId": "ChatStreamController_streamChat",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "x-request-id",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "Opcjonalny ID korelacji. Gdy brak, gateway ustawia req_<uuid> w odpowiedzi/błędzie.",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "example": "req_01HZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ"
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatRequestDto"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "SSE: event meta (SseMetaPayload), delta* (SseDeltaPayload), done (SseDonePayload)",
            "content": {
              "text/event-stream": {
                "schema": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "description": "Format: `event: <name>\\ndata: <json>\\n\\n`"
                },
                "examples": {
                  "meta": {
                    "value": "event: meta\ndata: {\"id\":\"gw_...\",\"provider\":\"anthropic\",\"model\":\"chat-default\",\"requestId\":\"req_...\",\"conversationId\":\"conv_...\"}\n\n"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Walidacja, MODEL_ALIAS_NOT_FOUND, MODEL_NOT_ALLOWED, STREAMING_NOT_SUPPORTED (stream)",
            "content": {
              "text/event-stream": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelopeDto"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "GATEWAY_KEY_MISSING",
            "content": {
              "text/event-stream": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelopeDto"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "GATEWAY_KEY_INVALID",
            "content": {
              "text/event-stream": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelopeDto"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "RATE_LIMITED lub PROVIDER_RATE_LIMITED",
            "content": {
              "text/event-stream": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelopeDto"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "INTERNAL_SERVER_ERROR, GATEWAY_KEY_NOT_CONFIGURED",
            "content": {
              "text/event-stream": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelopeDto"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "502": {
            "description": "PROVIDER_UNSUPPORTED, PROVIDER_UNAVAILABLE",
            "content": {
              "text/event-stream": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelopeDto"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "504": {
            "description": "PROVIDER_TIMEOUT",
            "content": {
              "text/event-stream": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorEnvelopeDto"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "security": [
          {
            "GatewayKeyAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "summary": "Chat (streaming)",
        "tags": [
          "Chat"
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/health": {
      "get": {
        "description": "Lekki probe procesu. Nie wymaga X-Gateway-Key.",
        "operationId": "HealthController_getLiveness",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "x-request-id",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "Opcjonalny ID korelacji. Gdy brak, gateway ustawia req_<uuid> w odpowiedzi/błędzie.",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "example": "req_01HZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HealthLivenessResponseDto"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "summary": "Liveness",
        "tags": [
          "Health"
        ]
      }
    },
    "/api/v1/health/ready": {
      "get": {
        "description": "HTTP zawsze 200; ocena po body.status (ready | not_ready). Nie wymaga X-Gateway-Key.",
        "operationId": "HealthController_getReadiness",
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "x-request-id",
            "in": "header",
            "description": "Opcjonalny ID korelacji. Gdy brak, gateway ustawia req_<uuid> w odpowiedzi/błędzie.",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "example": "req_01HZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HealthReadinessResponseDto"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "summary": "Readiness",
        "tags": [
          "Health"
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "headers": {
      "XRequestId": {
        "description": "Identyfikator korelacyjny żądania — echo nagłówka żądania `x-request-id` (jeśli niepusty) lub `req_<uuid>`. Ustawiany przez `RequestIdMiddleware` (`src/common/middleware/request-id.middleware.ts`) na wszystkich trasach z middleware. To samo ID co pole `requestId` w JSON (sukces, błąd, SSE `meta`).",
        "schema": {
          "type": "string"
        },
        "example": "req_123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000"
      }
    },
    "securitySchemes": {
      "GatewayKeyAuth": {
        "type": "apiKey",
        "in": "header",
        "name": "X-Gateway-Key",
        "description": "Klucz klienta (allowlista z gateway.config.yaml + env). Wymagany dla POST /chat i POST /chat/stream."
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "HealthLivenessResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "status",
          "timestamp"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "const": "healthy"
          },
          "timestamp": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time",
            "description": "ISO 8601 UTC (`new Date().toISOString()` w `HealthService.getLiveness` i `getReadiness`)."
          }
        }
      },
      "HealthCheckItem": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "status",
          "message"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "healthy",
              "degraded",
              "unhealthy"
            ]
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "HealthReadinessResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "status",
          "timestamp",
          "version",
          "uptime",
          "checks"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "ready",
              "not_ready"
            ]
          },
          "timestamp": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time",
            "description": "ISO 8601 UTC (`toISOString()` w `HealthService.getReadiness`)."
          },
          "version": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "uptime": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0,
            "description": "Czas działania procesu w sekundach (`process.uptime()`)."
          },
          "checks": {
            "type": "object",
            "additionalProperties": false,
            "required": [
              "config",
              "cache"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "config": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HealthCheckItem"
              },
              "cache": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HealthCheckItem",
                "description": "Stan backendu cache odpowiedzi (`noop` lub `redis` z `CACHE_*`). Nie dotyczy osobno smart rate limit."
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "ErrorEnvelope": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "statusCode",
          "code",
          "message",
          "requestId"
        ],
        "description": "Envelope błędów z `GlobalExceptionFilter`. Pole `message` jest zawsze stringiem (walidacja: `join('; ')`).",
        "properties": {
          "statusCode": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 400,
            "maximum": 599
          },
          "code": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Kod maszynowy z payloadu wyjątku lub `DEFAULT_HTTP_STATUS_TO_CODE` (`src/common/errors/api-error.code.ts`). Przykłady: `GATEWAY_KEY_*`, `RATE_LIMITED` (gateway), `PROVIDER_RATE_LIMITED` (upstream), `MODEL_*`, `PROVIDER_*`. Słownik: `docs/dictionary.md`."
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "requestId": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Z `RequestIdMiddleware` (nagłówek odpowiedzi `x-request-id` ma tę samą wartość) lub z payloadu wyjątku, jeśli jawnie nadpisane."
          },
          "details": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "Obecna implementacja zawsze emituje pustą tablicę.",
            "items": {}
          }
        }
      },
      "ChatRole": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "user",
          "assistant"
        ],
        "description": "Rola `system` w API jest zablokowana — system prompt z plików w `src/config/system-prompt/`."
      },
      "ChatMessage": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "role",
          "content"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "role": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatRole"
          },
          "content": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 3000
          }
        }
      },
      "ChatParams": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "temperature": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 2,
            "description": "Override; dozwolone tylko gdy alias ma `temperature` w `policy.params.allowOverrides`."
          },
          "maxOutputTokens": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 8192,
            "description": "Override; dozwolone tylko gdy alias ma `maxOutputTokens` w `allowOverrides`."
          }
        }
      },
      "ChatRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "modelAlias",
          "messages"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "modelAlias": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "messages": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 1,
            "maxItems": 150,
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatMessage"
            }
          },
          "conversationId": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^conv_[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[1-5][0-9a-f]{3}-[89ab][0-9a-f]{3}-[0-9a-f]{12}$",
            "description": "Opcjonalny identyfikator sesji w formacie `conv_<uuid>` (`ChatRequestDto`). **W request:** włącza `gen_ai.conversation.id` w Sentry; wymaga pełnej historii w `messages[]` od tury 2. **Gdy pominięty:** Sentry = pojedyncza wiadomość; gateway zwraca nowe `conv_<uuid>` w odpowiedzi. Zob. `docs/conversation-tracking.md`.",
            "example": "conv_123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000"
          },
          "params": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatParams"
          }
        }
      },
      "SseMetaPayload": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "id",
          "provider",
          "model",
          "requestId",
          "conversationId"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          },
          "provider": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          },
          "model": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "description": "Żądany `modelAlias` z body."
          },
          "effectiveModelAlias": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "description": "Obecne tylko gdy `ResilientExecutor` obsłużył żądanie na aliasie `fallback` z YAML (inny niż `model`)."
          },
          "requestId": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          },
          "conversationId": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "description": "ID sesji zwrócone klientowi (echo `conversationId` z body lub `conv_<uuid>` gdy brak w request). Grupowanie Sentry wymaga podania tego samego ID w body żądania."
          }
        }
      },
      "SseDeltaPayload": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "text"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "text": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "SseDonePayload": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "Runtime emituje pusty obiekt; `usage` w streamingu planowane.",
        "properties": {}
      },
      "ChatOutputText": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "type",
          "text"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "const": "text"
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        }
      },
      "ChatUsage": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "inputTokens": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0
          },
          "outputTokens": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0
          },
          "totalTokens": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0
          }
        }
      },
      "ChatResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "id",
          "provider",
          "model",
          "output",
          "requestId",
          "conversationId"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          },
          "provider": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          },
          "model": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "description": "Żądany `modelAlias` z body."
          },
          "effectiveModelAlias": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "description": "Obecne tylko po udanym fallbacku (`models[].fallback` w YAML) — alias faktycznie użyty do wywołania providera."
          },
          "output": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatOutputText"
              }
            ]
          },
          "usage": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatUsage"
          },
          "requestId": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1
          },
          "conversationId": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "description": "ID sesji zwrócone klientowi (echo `conversationId` z body lub `conv_<uuid>` gdy brak w request). Grupowanie w Sentry wymaga podania tego samego ID w body kolejnych żądań — patrz `docs/conversation-tracking.md`."
          },
          "cached": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "const": true
          },
          "cachedAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          }
        }
      },
      "ChatMessageDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "role": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "user",
              "assistant"
            ],
            "description": "Rola wiadomości. Rola system nie jest dozwolona — system prompt z plików serwera.",
            "example": "user"
          },
          "content": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Content of the message. Must be a string with a maximum length of 3000 characters.",
            "example": "Hello, how are you?"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "role",
          "content"
        ]
      },
      "ChatParamsDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "temperature": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "Override temperature for this request. Allowed only if listed in allowOverrides for modelAlias.",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 2,
            "example": 0.7
          },
          "maxOutputTokens": {
            "type": "number",
            "description": "Override max output tokens. Allowed only if listed in allowOverrides for modelAlias.",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 8192,
            "example": 1024
          }
        }
      },
      "ChatRequestDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "modelAlias": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Alias modelu z gateway.config.yaml",
            "example": "chat-default"
          },
          "messages": {
            "minItems": 1,
            "maxItems": 150,
            "description": "Historia wiadomości (1–150).",
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatMessageDto"
            }
          },
          "params": {
            "description": "Optional generation overrides. Only fields listed in allowOverrides for this modelAlias are accepted.",
            "allOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatParamsDto"
              }
            ]
          },
          "conversationId": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Opcjonalny conv_<uuid>. W request włącza grupowanie Sentry; w response zawsze zwracany ID.",
            "example": "conv_123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000",
            "pattern": "^conv_[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[1-5][0-9a-f]{3}-[89ab][0-9a-f]{3}-[0-9a-f]{12}$"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "modelAlias",
          "messages"
        ]
      },
      "ChatOutputTextDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "type": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "text"
            ],
            "example": "text"
          },
          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "Odpowiedź modelu..."
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "type",
          "text"
        ]
      },
      "ChatUsageDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "inputTokens": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 0
          },
          "outputTokens": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 0
          },
          "totalTokens": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 0
          }
        }
      },
      "ChatResponseDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "gw_01HZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ"
          },
          "provider": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "anthropic"
          },
          "model": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Żądany modelAlias z body",
            "example": "chat-default"
          },
          "effectiveModelAlias": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Tylko po udanym fallbacku w YAML",
            "example": "claude-sonnet"
          },
          "output": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatOutputTextDto"
          },
          "usage": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ChatUsageDto"
          },
          "requestId": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "conversationId": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "cached": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "enum": [
              true
            ],
            "description": "Tylko przy trafieniu cache"
          },
          "cachedAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "id",
          "provider",
          "model",
          "output",
          "requestId",
          "conversationId"
        ]
      },
      "ErrorEnvelopeDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "statusCode": {
            "type": "number",
            "example": 400,
            "minimum": 400,
            "maximum": 599
          },
          "code": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "VALIDATION_FAILED",
            "description": "Kod maszynowy; słownik: docs/dictionary.md"
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "modelAlias must be a string"
          },
          "requestId": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "req_01HZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZZ"
          },
          "details": {
            "type": "array",
            "description": "Obecna implementacja często zwraca [].",
            "example": []
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "statusCode",
          "code",
          "message",
          "requestId"
        ]
      },
      "HealthLivenessResponseDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "healthy"
            ],
            "example": "healthy"
          },
          "timestamp": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time",
            "example": "2026-05-19T12:00:00.000Z"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "status",
          "timestamp"
        ]
      },
      "HealthCheckItemDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "healthy",
              "degraded",
              "unhealthy"
            ]
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "Config is loaded"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "status",
          "message"
        ]
      },
      "HealthReadinessChecksDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "config": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HealthCheckItemDto"
          },
          "cache": {
            "description": "Backend cache odpowiedzi (noop/redis). Nie dotyczy smart rate limit.",
            "allOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HealthCheckItemDto"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "config",
          "cache"
        ]
      },
      "HealthReadinessResponseDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "ready",
              "not_ready"
            ]
          },
          "timestamp": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "version": {
            "type": "string",
            "example": "1.0.0"
          },
          "uptime": {
            "type": "number",
            "example": 42,
            "minimum": 0
          },
          "checks": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HealthReadinessChecksDto"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "status",
          "timestamp",
          "version",
          "uptime",
          "checks"
        ]
      },
      "SseMetaPayloadDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "provider": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "model": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Żądany modelAlias z body"
          },
          "effectiveModelAlias": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "Po fallbacku"
          },
          "requestId": {
            "type": "string"
          },
          "conversationId": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "id",
          "provider",
          "model",
          "requestId",
          "conversationId"
        ]
      },
      "SseDeltaPayloadDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "text": {
            "type": "string"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "text"
        ]
      },
      "SseDonePayloadDto": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {}
      }
    }
  }
}
